  caseFiles:
  - title: Case Notes
    body: "\u2022 A \"Scholarship Grant 2027\" form is shared in a student group.
      It uses the school logo.\n\u2022 The canteen's \"Scan to pay with PayLite\"
      poster looks normal, but up close the QR code is a sticker placed on top of
      the printed one."
  - title: How This Room Works
    body: '1. 6 questions arrive one at a time, in a new order each attempt.


      2.
      Case questions: pick the safest, most accurate answer (A-D).


      3. Messages
      and web pages: choose SCAM or LEGITIMATE.


      4. Not sure? Press HINT to
      see what to look at. After each answer you''ll see why it was right or wrong.


      Goal:
      score 870+ to finish the investigation.'
